<<<
INCONGRUOUS VOCABULARY. Austria-Hungary was no longer in a position, an’? she would, to shake off the German yoke.
===
**INCONGRUOUS VOCABULARY.** *Austria-Hungary was no longer in a position, an' she would, to shake off the German yoke.*
>>>

<<<
Be in a position to is a phrase
===
*Be in a position to* is a phrase
>>>

<<<
modernity; shake off the yoke, though a metaphor
===
modernity; *shake off the yoke,* though a metaphor
>>>

<<<
but what is an’ she would doing here? why not the obvious even if she had the desire? or, if an? she would is too dear to be let go, why not Austria now could not, an’ she would?
===
but what is *an' she would* doing here? why not the obvious *even if she had the desire?* or, if *an' she would* is too dear to be let go, why not *Austria now could not, an' she would?*
>>>

<<<
The goldfish an’? cannot live in this sentence-bowl
