<<<
incontinently, =straightway, is ar- | ehaic & now literary only. Its | connexion with incontinent =libidi- | nous, which is apt to suggest wrong guesses, is not a close one; the OED explains that it is from Latin in continenti tempore (in unbroken time), so that the in- of incontinently
===
**incontinently,** =straightway, is archaic & now literary only. Its connexion with *incontinent* =libidinous, which is apt to suggest wrong guesses, is not a close one; the OED explains that it is from Latin *in continenti tempore* (in unbroken time), so that the *in-* of *incontinently*
>>>

